  "prefLabel": "Den 101.03 Administer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Den 101.03 “Administer” means an act whereby a single dose of a drug is instilled into the body of, applied to the body of, or otherwise given to a person for immediate consumption or use.\n\nSource. #14140, eff 1-31-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/den100-500.html"
